Ferrum pin
----------

This demo clones [Ferrum](https://github.com/SynapticFour/Ferrum) at the
commit in PINNED_VERSIONS.txt (currently tag **v0.3.2**) and builds it
unpatched. Ferrum remains BUSL-1.1. Do not treat a green `./run` as an
Apache Ferrum binary.

Third-party
-----------

- GATK / Cromwell / Nextflow container images: Broad Institute / Seqera
  licences as published with those images.
- Dockstore TRS descriptors: licences of the upstream workflow
  repositories. This demo fetches a descriptor for the TRS client path
  and does not execute that WDL.
- GIAB / Platinum / 1000 Genomes public data: terms of those projects
  when the fetch path succeeds (otherwise a synthetic slice is generated
  and labelled).
- Crypt4GH demo keypair under demo/fixtures/crypt4gh-node/: generated for
  local demo only; not a production secret.
